10: ## 1. Executive Summary
11: 
12: This report delivers a comprehensive technical analysis and architectural blueprint for migrating the CineJoy webOS frontend (`app/js/views/home.js` and `app/css/`) to the authentic Google TV visual interface demonstrated by `.tmp_ref/theboringtv-lgwebos/`.
13: 
14: The modernization replaces legacy 2:3 vertical portrait cards (`220x330px`) with mathematically exact 16:9 landscape cards (`352x198px`), implements the Google TV `<section id="hero">` with 72px headline and interactive carousel indicators (`#dots`), deploys GPU-composited horizontal scroll strips (`.strip`) with dynamic `translateX` peek math, enforces strict zero DOM sink compliance (`document.createElement`, `textContent`), and wires debounced dynamic backdrop art crossfading across both hero rotation and card focus events.
15: 
