155: #### 1.3 Controller Logic Mapping (`app/js/views/home.js`)
156: 1. **Hero Item Carousel Array**: Maintain `this.heroItems = []` (up to 6 top titles from `trendingMovies`) and `this.heroIdx = 0`.
157: 2. **`showHero()` Method**:
158:    - Updates `#heroSrc.textContent = item.src || (item.media_type === 'tv' ? 'Trending Series' : 'Trending Movie')`.
159:    - Updates `#heroTitle.textContent = item.title || item.name`.
160:    - Updates `#heroMeta.textContent = [year, mediaType, ratingText, '4K Ultra HD'].filter(Boolean).join('  ·  ')`.
161:    - Updates `#heroSub.textContent = item.overview || ''`.
162:    - Updates `#heroBtn.textContent = 'Play Now'`.
163:    - Rebuilds `#dots`: clears child nodes and appends `<i>` elements (index === `heroIdx` receives class `on`).
164:    - Invokes `setBg(item.backdropUrl)` to initiate the backdrop crossfade.
165: 3. **Carousel Stepping & Rotation**:
166:    - `stepHero(direction)`: cycles `heroIdx = (heroIdx + direction + heroItems.length) % heroItems.length` and calls `showHero()`.
167:    - ArrowLeft / ArrowRight while focused on `#heroBtn` steps the carousel.
168:    - 8000ms interval timer: if user has been idle for > 7000ms while at the hero level, rotates `stepHero(1)`.
