172: ### Requirement 2: Exact 16:9 Card Proportions & Component Structure
173: 
174: #### 2.1 Geometric Specifications
175: - **Mathematical Ratio**: 16:9 ($352 \div 16 \times 9 = 22 \times 9 = 198\text{px}$).
176: - **Card Box**: `width: 352px; margin-right: 26px; display: inline-block; vertical-align: top; position: relative;`
177: - **Total Slot Width**: $352 + 26 = 378\text{px}$.
178: - **Preview Surface (`.pic`)**:
179:   - `height: 198px;`
180:   - `border-radius: 14px;`
181:   - `overflow: hidden;`
182:   - `background: #26292f;`
183:   - `position: relative;`
184:   - `transition: transform .2s ease, box-shadow .2s ease;`
185: - **Card Backdrop Image (`.pic img`)**:
186:   - `width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block;`
187:   - Uses `item.backdrop_path` (TMDB `w780` or `w500`), falling back to `item.poster_path` if unavailable.
188: - **Title Overlay (`.ttl`)**:
189:   - Position: `position: absolute; left: 16px; right: 16px; bottom: 12px;`
190:   - Typography: `font-size: 22px; font-weight: 500; color: #fff;`
191:   - Shadow: `text-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.9);`
192: - **Top-Left Chip (`.chip`)**:
193:   - Position: `position: absolute; top: 10px; left: 10px;`
194:   - Styling: `background: rgba(0,0,0,.6); padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 15px; color: #fff;`
195:   - Content: Rating (`★ 8.6`), badge, or resolution (`4K`).
196: - **Resting / Focus Caption (`.cap`)**:
197:   - Position: `margin-top: 14px;`
198:   - Typography: `font-size: 20px; color: #bdc1c6;`
199:   - Truncation: `white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis;`
200:   - Resting state: `opacity: 0; transition: opacity .2s;`
201:   - Focused state: `opacity: 1; color: #fff;`
202: - **Focus Ring / Halo**:
203:   - `.focus .pic, .focused .pic, .tv-focused .pic`:
204:     `transform: scale(1.1); box-shadow: 0 0 0 5px #fff, 0 12px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.6);`
205: 
206: #### 2.2 Backward Compatibility Bridge
207: To guarantee that existing test assertions searching for `.card-poster`, `.poster-img`, `.poster-title`, or `.poster-meta` pass without regressions, each generated card element combines both modern and legacy classes:
