267: ### Requirement 4: Strict Zero DOM Sink Compliance
268: 
269: #### 4.1 Vulnerability Review
270: The reference code in `theboringtv-lgwebos/app.js` repeatedly relies on `.innerHTML =`:
271: ```javascript
272: // FORBIDDEN PATTERN IN CINEJOY (theboringtv-lgwebos line 230, 245, 270, 428)
273: function el(tag, cls, html) { var e = document.createElement(tag); if (html) e.innerHTML = html; return e; }
274: $('dots').innerHTML = heroItems.map(function (_, i) { return '<i' + ...; }).join('');
275: ```
276: 
277: #### 4.2 Standardized Safe DOM Replacement Pattern
278: Every view update in `app/js/views/home.js` must exclusively use standard W3C DOM methods:
279: ```javascript
280: // 1. Container Clearing without innerHTML
281: while (container.firstChild) {
282:   container.removeChild(container.firstChild);
283: }
284: 
285: // 2. Element Creation and Attribute Assignment
286: var card = document.createElement('div');
287: card.className = 'card f card-poster';
288: card.setAttribute('data-nav', 'true');
289: card.setAttribute('data-nav-group', groupName);
290: card.setAttribute('data-nav-index', String(index));
291: 
292: // 3. Text Assignment with textContent (Automatic Encoding)
